   "textLength": 305,
   "text": "Finally, if all goes well, you’ll receive a mortgage commitment letter. This is a formal offer from the lender to loan you a certain amount, though this can be retracted if your financial situation changes or either you or the property are later found to have fallen short of the lender’s qualifications.5",
